{"schema":1,"locale":"zh-Hans","created_at":"2026-11-28T16:56:48.535Z","entries":{"docs-7.25\u0000## file **Type:** Directory":"## file \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## file/rsync-daemon **Package:** rose-storage **Type:** Settings Directory":"## file/rsync-daemon \n**Package:** rose-storage\n**Type:** 设置目录","docs-7.25\u0000## file/sync **Package:** rose-storage **Type:** Directory":"## file/sync \n**Package:** rose-storage\n**Type:** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## file/sync/monitor **Package:** rose-storage **Type:** Command":"## file/sync/monitor \n**包：** rose-storage\n**类型：** Command","docs-7.25\u0000## file/tail **Type:** Command":"## file/tail \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.25\u0000## import **Type:** Command":"## import \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/6to4 **Type:** Directory":"## interface/6to4 \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/blink **Type:** Command":"## interface/blink \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/bonding **Type:** Directory":"## interface/bonding \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/bonding/monitor **Type:** Command":"## interface/bonding/monitor \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/bonding/monitor-slaves **Type:** Command":"## interface/bonding/monitor-slaves \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.25\u0000Command is used to monitor individual bonding ports.":"该命令用于监控各个 bonding 端口。","docs-7.25\u0000Prints the last lines of a file's contents. With `as-value`, the lines are returned as an array of strings in `lines`. See the [Files](LINK) guide.":"打印文件内容的最后几行。使用 `as-value` 时，这些行会作为字符串数组返回到 `lines` 中。详情请参阅 [Files](/docs/7.25/system-information-and-utilities/files#head-or-tail-a-file) 指南。","docs-7.25\u0000Reads a chunk of a file's contents and returns it as a string in `data`. Works with files of any size, unlike the `contents` property, which is limited to just under 60 KiB. See the [Files](LINK) guide.":"读取文件内容的一个数据块，并以字符串形式返回到 `data` 中。适用于任意大小的文件，不同于 `contents` 属性，后者限制为略低于 60 KiB。请参阅 [Files](/docs/7.25/system-information-and-utilities/files#read-file-contents) 指南。","docs-7.25\u0000[6to4](LINK) is a special mechanism that allows IPv6 packets to be transmitted over IPv4 networks.":"[6to4](/docs/7.25/virtual-private-networks/6to4) 是一种特殊机制，允许通过 IPv4 网络传输 IPv6 数据包。"}}
